  "description": "The meme relies on the derogatory phonetic pun 'retodd' which is a crude, offensive play on the word 'retard', historically used to demean people with intellectual or developmental disabilities. This is an example of ableist stereotyping that reduces individuals to a punchline and perpetuates harmful societal attitudes.",
